            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "subheading": "",
            "content": "<h5>Ease of Use</h5><p>Flow dashboards were simple enough for store managers to understand without extensive training. The interface focused on practical retail KPIs rather than overwhelming users with complex analytics.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
